    "BlindWrite Sub Code File",
    "4.0",
    "Supplementary disk image file created with BlindRead or BlindWrite software; contains sub codes, or sub channel data, related to a specific disc image; optionally saved along with a.BWI and.BWT file. Windows VSO Software BlindWrite.",
