    ".DAA",
    "PowerISO Direct-Access-Archive",
    "3.9",
    "Proprietary disk image file format used by PowerISO, a disk imaging application; can be compressed, encrypted, password protected, and split into multiple volumes; used for mounting virtual file systems as disk drives, as well as protecting sensitive data. Compressed DAA files may be extracted, mounted, and edited without being decompressed first. Windows PowerISO. EZB Systems UltraISO. WinArchiver. DAA2ISO. Mac PowerISO. Twilight Edge DAA Converter. Linux PowerISO for Linux AcetoneISO.",
    "Windows PowerISO. EZB Systems UltraISO. WinArchiver. DAA2ISO. Mac PowerISO. Twilight Edge DAA Converter. Linux PowerISO for Linux AcetoneISO.",
